WEBVTT

00:01:45.991 --> 00:01:48.901
Soul Contract

00:01:50.788 --> 00:01:53.896
19th Contract

00:01:55.319 --> 00:01:57.430
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:00.078 --> 00:02:01.192
Poor kid

00:02:01.192 --> 00:02:02.245
I don't know...

00:02:02.245 --> 00:02:04.636
Look at how people drive these days

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.955
So pity

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:09.548
So young yet...

00:02:09.846 --> 00:02:11.350
Such an unfortunate kid

00:02:15.174 --> 00:02:17.473
What about his parents?

00:02:19.217 --> 00:02:20.310
But this boy

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:21.967
I've seen him before

00:02:22.956 --> 00:02:24.008
So terrible

00:02:24.008 --> 00:02:25.259
Don't squeeze

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:27.740
The last bloodline of Yang family

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.070
is now gone

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.170
This boy is so unfortunate

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.170
You are...?

00:02:35.477 --> 00:02:36.722
What a coincidence

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.280
You're the first living person I meet after I come out

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.500
and you're a Yangming Master too

00:02:41.819 --> 00:02:42.990
Little priest

00:02:43.253 --> 00:02:44.554
Your luck

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.720
isn't so good after all

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:49.170
You...!

00:02:53.944 --> 00:02:57.466
You can actually read the mind of spirits

00:02:59.586 --> 00:03:00.600
This power

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.860
is the proof that it comes from Hell

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:04.060
So, you and I

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.605
are fated to enter the Netherworld

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:13.920
Do you know who I am?

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.010
I know

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:17.641
And do you know what I want?

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:18.780
I know

00:03:19.108 --> 00:03:22.847
I was sealed by the bloodline of Yang family

00:03:23.124 --> 00:03:24.987
Now that the seal is broken,

00:03:24.987 --> 00:03:28.139
his soul will get dissipated after 7 days

00:03:28.139 --> 00:03:31.201
No one in this world will be able to stop me

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.120
Not even you, little priest

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:36.960
What if he survives after 7 days?

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:39.340
I was a Yangming Master too

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.470
I know your lifespan

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:45.830
How long can you keep him survive?

00:03:45.832 --> 00:03:46.562
1 year

00:03:46.906 --> 00:03:48.565
I swear by my soul

00:03:48.565 --> 00:03:50.656
He will never be a wandering soul

00:03:50.656 --> 00:03:52.831
Neither will he become an evil spirit

00:03:52.831 --> 00:03:54.406
till I die

00:03:54.784 --> 00:03:56.829
Do you dare to take a bet?

00:04:01.456 --> 00:04:02.488
Very well

00:04:02.488 --> 00:04:07.740
Let's see how you plan to go against fate

00:04:11.156 --> 00:04:13.321
You have lost the bet

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.380
Yang Jinghua's soul is already gone

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.861
He won't return anymore

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.240
Monster

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:25.230
Don't come near

00:04:29.148 --> 00:04:32.550
A trash like you gets called a Soul Manipulator?

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:37.890
Nothing but a baffoon

00:04:37.891 --> 00:04:40.064
who dares to be rash

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.530
You little priest

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.180
You think I will not kill you?

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.640
Sorry to disappoint you, senpai

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.310
I haven't lost yet

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.080
And you try to suppress me with this sword?

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.660
You are not Yangning

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.320
I know

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.080
You have no power to suppress me

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.260
I know

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:07.090
Then how else you plan to stop me?

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:11.210
With my life!

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:37.710
2nd Lady is indeed talented

00:05:38.018 --> 00:05:39.123
It's nothing

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.590
It's part of my duty

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.800
2nd Lady is great yet so humble

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.380
That's how a Yangming Master suppose to conduct

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.530
Old Lady

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.626
What do you say?

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.000
Old Lady,

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.500
the seat of Yangming Master cannot simply be left empty

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.020
Since 2nd Lady has purified the demonic spirit

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.280
Her capability is enough proof

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:04.360
For the sake of the Duanmu family, you must consider taking the right decision

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.460
by making her a Yangming Master

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.025
Stop your nonsense

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.080
Or, do I say,

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:14.770
you're really that scared?

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:21.320
How can you simply displace a Yangming Master?

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:22.460
If there's anything,

00:06:22.463 --> 00:06:24.727
wait till Duanmu comes back

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:31.760
Duanmu family sent out so many people to search for him

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.260
but where is he?

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.300
I've made a promise with Yang Jinghua

00:06:35.306 --> 00:06:37.634
He will surely bring Duanmu back

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:40.880
That Soul Image is nowhere to be seen

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.250
You still say without proof, Miss Qin

00:06:43.258 --> 00:06:44.872
Instead of bluffing,

00:06:44.872 --> 00:06:47.696
why don't you show concrete evidence?

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.080
I'm an outsider

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.580
I can only rely on my identity as a Qin family

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.610
and my fiery yang physique

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.600
So please wait till sunrise

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:59.080
If Duanmu still hasn't returned,

00:06:59.081 --> 00:07:01.972
I swear, as long as I'm around,

00:07:01.972 --> 00:07:06.211
that the Qin family shall never meddle with the Yangming Master's affair

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.240
As for me,

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:13.460
I shall willingly stay in Duanmu household as a tool for the next Yangming Master

00:07:23.138 --> 00:07:27.123
Is it even worth trusting a mere Soul Image?

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:35.840
Strange

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:37.530
Why am I here?

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:40.620
Dad

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.460
Mom

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:42.640
Oh yeah

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.880
They are already...

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:45.640
Not just them

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.265
You're dead too

00:07:47.534 --> 00:07:48.271
Me?

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.500
Go now

00:07:50.505 --> 00:07:52.899
Your parents are waiting for you

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:57.760
No

00:07:57.763 --> 00:07:59.171
I can't move

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.700
What are you hesitating?

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:10.640
There's nothing else you desire by staying in this world

00:08:13.499 --> 00:08:14.934
That's not it

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.190
Yang Jinghua

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:18.400
Who?

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.650
Yang Jinghua

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.200
That's right

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.999
I can't go yet

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.840
Yang Jinghua!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:33.780
Duanmu Luoye

00:08:34.232 --> 00:08:35.466
Idiot

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.000
You wasted my kindness for you

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:38.960
Scram

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:42.540
This is what you chose

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.620
But he is calling me

00:08:45.845 --> 00:08:47.361
So what?

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.000
Yangming Master and Soul Image

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.840
It's like the relationship of a master and a dog

00:08:52.095 --> 00:08:53.548
I've told you already

00:08:53.548 --> 00:08:55.189
He's calling me!

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:08.700
Jinghua

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:20.460
I'll send you both to Hell

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.330
Don't touch him

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.240
Not only will I touch him,

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:27.330
I'll also f*ck you till your body and mind are tainted

00:09:27.332 --> 00:09:29.095
I'll devour your soul

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.900
Painful, eh?

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.200
Jinghua

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.860
I only went off-line for a few minutes

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.040
and you become like this?

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.200
You actually broke my manipulation spell

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.750
Brat

00:10:14.751 --> 00:10:16.861
You oughta call me grand-daddy

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:22.220
You had so much fun tormenting Duanmu, hadn't you?

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.540
Now you know who covers for him?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.730
I won't let you stay together even if I die

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:42.480
All along,

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.370
I've been watching over him

00:10:44.378 --> 00:10:46.294
He's just a simple guy

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.340
He sacrificed his all for the world

00:10:49.342 --> 00:10:52.249
yet the world never thanks him

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:56.780
I won't let him get stepped over by others or get bullied anymore

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:58.000
Yes

00:10:58.002 --> 00:10:59.872
I finally understand

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:02.700
From now on,

00:11:02.707 --> 00:11:05.033
those that you can't hack, I'll hack them for you

00:11:05.033 --> 00:11:07.500
Those that you can't hurt, I'll kill for you

00:11:07.519 --> 00:11:09.970
If you still want to protect this world,

00:11:10.315 --> 00:11:12.020
then I will

00:11:12.034 --> 00:11:13.540
protect you

00:11:15.955 --> 00:11:20.299
It's the entire reason I stay in this world!

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.860
Miss Qin's determination seriously impresses me

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:28.260
but we have a deal

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:29.380
Old Lady

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:31.220
The sun is rising

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.270
Ma'am

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.140
May the 2nd Lady

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.210
be the Yangming Master

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:42.120
May the 2nd Lady fulfill her duty

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.640
I, Duanmu Siyun,

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.490
will take all responsibility

00:11:56.491 --> 00:11:58.585
and will not disappoint all

00:11:58.580 --> 00:11:59.820
2nd Lady,

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.210
as you may

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:23.260
I, Yang Jinghua,

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.220
am the Soul Image of Yangming Master

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.880
The only Yangming Master, whom I recognize, is Duamu Xi

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.180
Anyone who objects

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.460
must go through me first
